"</guiicon>"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:652 C/gnumeric.xml:57 C/gnumeric.xml:444
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Using a Keyboard Shortcut</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Via ett kortkommando</emphasis>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:656
msgid ""
"Type the combination "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>, typing both "
"keys simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Tryck samtidigt på "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>o</keysym></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:605
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog can be launched using three "
"alternative approaches. <_:variablelist-1/> All three methods will result in"
" the equivalent action, launching the <interface>File Open</interface> "
"dialog to allow the user to find the file that they wish to open."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> kan öppnas på tre olika sätt. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> Alla tre metoderna leder till samma resultat: "
"dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> öppnas så att du kan leta upp "
"filen."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:677
msgid "Navigate the file system to open the folder with the file."
msgstr "Navigera i filsystemet till mappen som innehåller filen."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:681
msgid ""
"Changing folders involves selecting a starting folder in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> which contains the folder with the desired file, "
"and then double-clicking on the folders listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> until the folder containing the file has been "
"reached. The folder hierarchy listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>can also be used to navigate up the hierarchy if a"
" folder was opened by mistake. As explained below, a user can move around "
"the hierarchy with as many folder selections as they need to reach the "
"folder containing the file the user desires to open."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill byta mapp väljer du en startmapp i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> som innehåller mappen du söker. Dubbelklicka "
"sedan på mapparna i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> tills du "
"kommer till mappen med filen. Du kan också använda mappträdet i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> för att gå uppåt om du råkat öppna fel "
"mapp. Du kan byta mappar så många gånger som behövs för att hitta filen."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:696
msgid ""
"To select a new folder, one of the starting folders which contains the "
"desired folder must first be selected and then the hierarchy must be "
"navigated to find the desired folder, and this folder must be opened to "
"expose its contents. As explained below, a user can move around the "
"hierarchy using as many changes as they need to choose the folder in which "
"to save their <application>Gnumeric</application> file."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill välja en ny mapp börjar du med att välja en startmapp som "
"innehåller den. Navigera sedan i mappträdet tills du hittar mappen och öppna"
" den så att innehållet visas. Du kan gå mellan mappar så många gånger som "
"behövs för att välja mappen där du vill spara filen i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:708
msgid "Select a starting folder in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."
msgstr "Välj en startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:712
msgid ""
"The first step in choosing a new folder requires selecting, in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, a starting folder which contains the "
"desired folder. The new starting folder is chosen by placing the mouse "
"pointer over the folder name and double clicking (click twice rapidly "
"without moving the mouse) with the primary mouse button. This will change "
"the leftmost button in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> and change "
"the folders and files listed in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> to"
" list the contents of the starting folder which was just selected."
msgstr ""
"Välj först en startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> som "
"innehåller mappen du söker. Håll pekaren över namnet på mappen och "
"dubbelklicka med primär musknapp, det vill säga klicka snabbt två gånger "
"utan att flytta pekaren. Då ändras den vänstra knappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> och listan i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> visar innehållet i den valda startmappen."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:728
msgid ""
"Navigate the filesystem to reach the desired folder using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Navigera i filsystemet till mappen du söker med område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:732
msgid ""
"The next step involves descending the folder tree to reach the desired "
"folder. This requires double clicking the sub-folder of the staring folder "
"which contains the desired folder and continuing through the whole hierarchy"
" until the desired folder is reached. After each double click, the selected "
"folder is added as the right most button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> and the contents of the selected folder are shown"
" in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. Once the desired folder is "
"reached, it must be opened in the same way, so that its contents are listed "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> and the file can then be saved "
"into this folder by clicking on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Fortsätt sedan nedåt i mappträdet tills du kommer till mappen du söker. "
"Dubbelklicka på den undermapp i startmappen som innehåller nästa mapp, och "
"fortsätt genom hela trädet. Efter varje dubbelklick läggs den valda mappen "
"till som den högra knappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>, "
"och innehållet visas i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. När du "
"kommer till rätt mapp öppnar du den på samma sätt. Då visas innehållet i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och du kan spara filen där genom"
" att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:751
msgid ""
"Navigating back up the folder tree using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Gå uppåt i mappträdet med hjälp av område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:755
msgid ""
"If the sub-folder selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> does"
" not contain the branch of the folder tree leading to the desired folder, "
"the buttons in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> can be used to jump"
" further up the folder tree but only as far as the starting folder selected "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> provides a list of buttons with the names of all "
"the folders between the starting folder listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and the currently selected folder. By clicking on"
" one of these buttons, that is by placing the mouse pointer over the button "
"and clicking with the primary mouse button, the folder listed on the button "
"will be opened in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> so that the "
"selection process can restart from this branch."
msgstr ""
"Om undermappen du valt i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> inte "
"leder till mappen du söker kan du använda knapparna i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> för att gå uppåt i mappträdet. Du kan bara gå så "
"långt som till startmappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. "
"Område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> visar en knapp för varje mapp "
"mellan startmappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och den "
"valda mappen. Klicka på en knapp för att öppna den mappen i område <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och fortsätta navigeringen därifrån."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:780
msgid "Select the file."
msgstr "Välj filen."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:783
msgid ""
"The file must be selected by placing the mouse pointer over the filename in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> and clicking with the primary "
"mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Markera filen genom att föra pekaren till filnamnet i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och klicka med primär musknapp."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:790
msgid ""
"The file can be opened and the dialog dismissed by selecting the file with a"
" double click of the primary mouse button. The last two steps are optional "
"and, if configured appropriately, the file can be selected and opened simply"
" by double clicking on the file name."
msgstr ""
"Du kan öppna filen och stänga dialogrutan genom att dubbelklicka på filen "
"med primär musknapp. De två sista stegen är valfria. Om dialogrutan är rätt "
"inställd räcker det att dubbelklicka på filnamnet för att välja och öppna "
"filen."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:802
msgid "Optional: Select the file format type."
msgstr "Valfritt: Välj filformat."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:805
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can automatically recognize the file "
"format type. Alternatively, the file format can be specified explicitly by "
"clicking on the drop down list button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> and scrolling down the list to the desired file "
"type."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan identifiera filformatet automatiskt."
" Du kan också ange formatet själv genom att öppna rullgardinsmenyn i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> och bläddra till önskad filtyp."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:827
msgid "Optional: Determine the file character encoding."
msgstr "Valfritt: Ange filens teckenkodning."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:830
msgid ""
"For text files the character encoding must be specified. By default, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> takes the character encoding appropriate"
" to the user's locale. This encoding scheme can be changed by clicking on "
"the drop down menu button in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> and "
"navigating the menus to find the desired encoding."
msgstr ""
"För textfiler behöver du ange teckenkodningen. Som standard använder "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kodningen för användarens systemlokal. "
"Ändra kodningen genom att öppna rullgardinsmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> och välja önskad kodning."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:842
msgid "Click the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:845
msgid ""
"Finally, the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button must be pressed by placing "
"the mouse pointer over the button and clicking with the primary mouse "
"button."
msgstr "Till sist klickar du på knappen <guibutton>Öppna</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:853
msgid ""
"The file will be opened in a new window. If the selected file format was "
"\"Text import (configurable)\" the <interface>Text Import</interface> druid "
"will be opened. This druid is explained in great detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Filen öppnas i ett nytt fönster. Om du valde filformatet ”Textimport "
"(konfigurerbar)” öppnas guiden <interface>Textimport</interface>. Den "
"beskrivs utförligt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:866 C/gnumeric.xml:1123
msgid "Changing the list of bookmark folders."
msgstr "Ändra listan med bokmärkesmappar."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:870
msgid ""
"The list of starting folders shown in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> of <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-"
"components\"/> may contain starting folders selected by the user. These "
"folders are called 'bookmark folders' and are listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> below a thin horizontal separator line. For "
"example, <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> contains a "
"folder named <filename>currentWork</filename> which is a bookmark folder "
"selected by the user."
msgstr ""
"I område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"open-dialog-components\"/> kan listan innehålla startmappar som användaren "
"själv har valt. De kallas bokmärkesmappar och visas under en tunn vågrät "
"avdelare i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. I <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> är mappen "
"<filename>currentWork</filename> ett bokmärke som användaren har lagt till."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:883
msgid ""
"These bookmark folders can be added in two ways. A folder which is selected "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> can be added as a bookmark by "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till bokmärkesmappar på två sätt. Om en mapp är markerad i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> klickar du på knappen "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:891
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the folder can be dragged from area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> into area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. "
"The folder can be dragged by placing the mouse pointer over the folder name "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, clicking and holding the "
"primary mouse button, moving the mouse pointer to area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and releasing the mouse button. As the mouse "
"pointer is moved from area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> to area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, a small icon of the folder will move "
"with the mouse pointer."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också dra mappen från område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> "
"till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Håll pekaren över namnet "
"på mappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, håll ned primär "
"musknapp, flytta pekaren till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> "
"och släpp knappen. En liten ikon av mappen följer med pekaren när du drar "
"den från område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> till område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:905
msgid ""
"Any bookmark folder can also be removed from the list of starting folders "
"presented in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. A bookmark folder "
"can be removed by clicking on the folder name in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and then clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också ta bort en bokmärkesmapp från listan över startmappar i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Markera mappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och klicka sedan på <guibutton>Ta "
"bort</guibutton> i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:931
msgid "The file formats which Gnumeric can read."
msgstr "Filformat som Gnumeric kan läsa."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:933
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files which have been created "
"in several formats by other spreadsheet programs or databases. The details "
"of these formats are provided in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/> and "
"the name of each file type in the table below skips to the appropriate "
"section of <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. The opening of text "
"formatted files is described in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can also import text data or HTML and "
"XHTML tables through the clipboard mechanism, as is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna filer i flera format som "
"skapats av andra kalkylprogram eller databaser. Mer information finns i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. Namnen på filformaten i tabellen "
"nedan länkar till respektive avsnitt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"formats\"/>. I <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/> beskrivs hur du "
"öppnar textfiler. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan också importera "
"textdata och tabeller i formaten HTML och XHTML via urklippet, enligt <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:949
msgid ""
"Most of these formats are provided by plugins, which are independent, "
"configurable modules. If a format described below does not appear in the "
"<interface>File Open</interface> dialog, this may be because the appropriate"
