msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> - The 'relative root' selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> – Område för val av ”relativ rot”."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:671
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to select the starting folder from which to "
"navigate the folder hierarchy. The navigation system only allows users to "
"select sub-folders of the currently selected 'relative root' folder so the "
"root folder selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> must "
"contain the desired folder as a sub-folder."
msgstr ""
"Här väljer du startmappen för navigering i mapphierarkin. Du kan bara välja "
"undermappar till den valda ”relativa roten”. Därför måste mappen som väljs i"
" område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> innehålla den önskade mappen."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:681
msgid ""
"The folders listed in this area include the standard folders provided by the"
" system and a number of folders added, as bookmark folders, by the user. The"
" standard folders provided by the system will vary for different machines "
"and system administrators may have disabled access to certain areas. By "
"default, the standard folders provided include the user's 'Home' folder, the"
" user's 'Desktop' folder, a folder pointing to the root of the filesystem "
"tree and folders for each of the removable storage devices attached to the "
"computer. The user's home folder, on GNU and other UNIX like systems, this "
"folder is usually known as <literal>~</literal> or "
"<literal>~user_account_name</literal> where the phrase "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> represents the account name used by the"
" current user. This folder is often located at "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> in the filesystem. The "
"'Desktop' folder is the folder which holds the files which are displayed in "
"the background of the user's window. The 'Filesystem' folder is the top of "
"the filesystem tree, which on GNU systems is also known as "
"<filename>/</filename>. The list also presents peripheral or external "
"devices. Below the standard folders, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> has a separator and the bookmark folders selected"
" by the user. In <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> the folder <filename>currentWork</filename> is a folder named"
" by the user and added to the list of bookmark folders."
msgstr ""
"Listan innehåller systemets standardmappar och eventuella mappar som "
"användaren har lagt till som bokmärken. Standardmapparna kan variera mellan "
"datorer, och systemadministratören kan ha begränsat åtkomsten till vissa "
"platser. Som standard visas användarens hemmapp ”Hem”, skrivbordsmappen "
"”Skrivbord”, en mapp till filsystemets rot och mappar för anslutna flyttbara"
" lagringsenheter. I GNU och andra Unix-liknande system skrivs hemmappen "
"vanligtvis som <literal>~</literal> eller "
"<literal>~user_account_name</literal>, där "
"<literal>user_account_name</literal> står för den aktuella användarens "
"kontonamn. Mappen finns ofta på "
"<filename>/home/user_account_name/</filename> i filsystemet. "
"Skrivbordsmappen innehåller filerna som visas på skrivbordets bakgrund. "
"Mappen ”Filsystem” är filsystemets översta nivå, även kallad "
"<filename>/</filename> på GNU-system. Listan visar också kringutrustning och"
" externa enheter. Under standardmapparna i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> finns en avdelare och användarens "
"bokmärkesmappar. I <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> är <filename>currentWork</filename> en användarskapad mapp "
"som lagts till bland bokmärkena."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:718
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> - The folder hierarchy area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> – Mapphierarkin."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:722
msgid ""
"This area displays the folder hierarchy starting from the starting folder "
"selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and ending in the "
"current folder, the folder whose contents are displayed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, while displaying all the folders between the "
"two. This area changes dynamically as the user changes to new folders. In "
"the case shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/>, the user has selected the 'Home' folder as the starting "
"folder in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and has not navigated to"
" any sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"Här visas mapphierarkin från startmappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> till den aktuella mappen, vars innehåll visas i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, samt alla mappar däremellan. "
"Visningen ändras när du navigerar till andra mappar. I exemplet i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> har användaren valt "
"”Home” som startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> och ännu "
"inte navigerat till någon undermapp."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:741
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> - The Folder Creation button."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> – Knappen Skapa mapp."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:745
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to create a folder in the directory listed in "
"the rightmost part of the file component area, area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. When this button is clicked, by placing the "
"mouse pointer over the button and clicking with the primary mouse button, a "
"new folder is added to the list in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>"
" with a temporary name of '<filename>Type name of New Folder</filename>' "
"pre-selected and therefore ready to be edited into a new name."
msgstr ""
"Med knappen skapar du en mapp i katalogen som visas längst till höger i "
"mapphierarkin, område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. Klicka på "
"knappen med primär musknapp. En ny mapp läggs till i listan i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> med det tillfälliga namnet "
"<filename>Type name of New Folder</filename> markerat, så att du kan skriva "
"ett nytt namn direkt."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:762
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> - The folder content area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> – Mappinnehållet."

#. (itstool) path: warning/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:778
msgid ""
"Firstly, hidden folders and files, those that start with a leading period, "
"are not displayed by default. These can be shown by placing the mouse "
"pointer over area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, clicking with one of"
" the secondary mouse buttons to raise the context menu, moving the pointer "
"onto the <guimenuitem>Show hidden files</guimenuitem> menu entry, and "
"clicking with the primary mouse button. This step will ensure that all the "
"folders are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dolda mappar och filer, vars namn börjar med en punkt, visas inte som "
"standard. Visa dem genom att öppna snabbmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, välja <guimenuitem>Visa dolda "
"filer</guimenuitem> och klicka med primär musknapp. Då visas alla mappar."

#. (itstool) path: warning/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:791
msgid ""
"Secondly, the filtering rule defined in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> will limit the files displayed based on the "
"characteristics of these files. By default, a filtering rule is applied "
"which causes only those files present that have an extension commonly used "
"for spreadsheet files. The rule can be changed to display all the files "
"regardless of their extension, except possibly for the hidden files."
msgstr ""
"Filtreringsregeln i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> begränsar "
"också vilka filer som visas. Som standard visas bara filer med en filändelse"
" som vanligtvis används för kalkylblad. Du kan ändra regeln så att alla "
"filer visas oavsett filändelse, eventuellt med undantag för dolda filer."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:767
msgid ""
"This area displays the contents of the currently selected folder which is "
"the rightmost folder shown in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. "
"<_:warning-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Här visas innehållet i den valda mappen, alltså mappen längst till höger i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. <_:warning-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:809
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">J</emphasis> - The panel rearrangement handles."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">J</emphasis> – Handtag för att ändra panelernas "
"storlek."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:828
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis> - The bookmark folder list modification"
" buttons."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis> – Knappar för att ändra listan med "
"bokmärkesmappar."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:834
msgid ""
"These buttons will add or remove folders to or from the list of bookmark "
"folders in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. The "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button will add the folder currently selected in "
"area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. The <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>"
" button will remove any bookmark folder that is selected in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Med knapparna lägger du till eller tar bort mappar i listan med "
"bokmärkesmappar i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> lägger till mappen som är vald i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>. <guibutton>Ta bort</guibutton> tar "
"bort den bokmärkesmapp som är vald i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gnumeric.xml:849
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> - The filter definition area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">L</emphasis> – Filterinställningar."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:854
msgid ""
"This area contains a drop down menu with the different filters defined by "
"the application. <application>Gnumeric</application> currently defines two "
"filters. The first filters out all files that do not have an extension used "
"by the spreadsheet formats supported by gnumeric. The second filter, labeled"
" \"All files\", essentially disables any filtering operation, and lists all "
"the files in the currently selected folder, except that files starting with "
"a leading period are not shown."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en lista med programmets filter. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har för närvarande två filter. Det "
"första döljer filer vars filändelser inte används av kalkylbladsformat som "
"stöds av Gnumeric. Det andra, ”Alla filer”, stänger i praktiken av "
"filtreringen och visar alla filer i den valda mappen, utom filer vars namn "
"börjar med en punkt."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:650
msgid ""
"The different parts of each panel of the <interface>File Save</interface> "
"dialog after it has been expanded have been shaded with boxes of different "
"colors and labeled with a letter in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-"
"expanded-components\"/>. Five of the labeled areas are the same as the areas"
" in the dialog when it is in a compact form; these areas were explained "
"above. The remaining areas are explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna av varje panel i den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"fil</interface> är skuggade i olika färger och märkta med bokstäver i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/>. Fem av områdena är "
"desamma som i den kompakta dialogrutan och beskrevs ovan. De övriga "
"förklaras här: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:874
msgid ""
"The uses of the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog in its expanded form"
" is explained below."
msgstr ""
"Nedan beskrivs hur den utfällda dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface>"
" används."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:885
msgid "Changing the currently selected folder."
msgstr "Byta vald mapp."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:889
msgid ""
"In order to save a file in a folder other than that provided by default, it "
"is necessary to change the default folder. The note below explains briefly "
"the notion of folders and the procedure further down explains how to change "
"folders."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill spara filen i en annan mapp än standardmappen måste du byta mapp."
" Kommentaren nedan förklarar kort hur mappar fungerar, och instruktionerna "
"längre fram visar hur du byter mapp."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:914
msgid ""
"In GNU and UNIX systems, all of the files are stored in folders organized in"
" a single, unified filesystem tree with a folder named "
"'<filename>/</filename>' at the absolute root of the tree. Every file is "
"accessible from this absolute root folder and, by default, this folder is "
"provided as the choice named <filename>Filesystem</filename> with an icon of"
" a disk drive in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> in the "
"<interface>File Save</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"I GNU- och Unix-system lagras alla filer i mappar i ett gemensamt "
"filsystemträd. Trädets absoluta rot är en mapp som heter "
"”<filename>/</filename>”. Alla filer nås från den här rotmappen. Som "
"standard visas den som ”<filename>Filesystem</filename>” med en hårddiskikon"
" i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> i dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:925
msgid ""
"Navigating the directory tree from the single root folder would quickly "
"become burdensome and the <interface>File Save</interface> dialog provides "
"several other starting points in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. "
"These will be called, in this documentation, the 'relative root' folders "
"since each of these will act as the root of the branching structure of sub-"
"folders the relative root folder contains. Two relative root folders which "
"are commonly provided are the 'Home' and 'Desktop' folders for the current "
"user."
msgstr ""
"Det skulle snabbt bli omständligt att navigera i katalogträdet från en enda "
"rotmapp. Därför visar dialogrutan <interface>Spara fil</interface> flera "
"andra startpunkter i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. I den här "
"dokumentationen kallas de ”relativa rötter”, eftersom var och en fungerar "
"som rot för sina egna undermappar. Vanliga relativa rötter är användarens "
"mappar ”Hem” och ”Skrivbord”."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:938
msgid ""
"In a complex computer system, the absolute root folder may be hidden from "
"the user and only 'relative roots' will be present. These should jointly "
"provide some way to access all the areas where the user can save files."
msgstr ""
"På komplexa datorsystem kan den absoluta rotmappen vara dold för användaren,"
" så att bara ”relativa rötter” visas. Tillsammans bör de ge åtkomst till "
"alla platser där användaren kan spara filer."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:945
msgid ""
"The 'relative roots' are also necessary when several file systems are "
"available to the user. This will be the case when filesystem on other "
"machines are accessible over a network or when "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> is running on operating systems whose "
"filesystems are not unified, such as the proprietary operating systems sold "
"by Microsoft in which each disk drive has its own root named, for example, "
"<filename>C:\\</filename> or <filename>D:\\</filename>."
msgstr ""
"”Relativa rötter” behövs också när användaren har tillgång till flera "
"filsystem. Det gäller till exempel när filsystem på andra datorer nås via "
"nätverket eller när <application>Gnumeric</application> körs på "
"operativsystem med separata filsystem, som Microsofts operativsystem där "
"varje diskenhet har en egen rot, till exempel <filename>C:\\</filename> "
"eller <filename>D:\\</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:956
msgid ""
"Additional 'relative root' folders can be added as 'bookmark folders' by the"
" users themselves. These bookmark folders can be used to access quickly "
"folders which are commonly used. The bookmark folders are listed, in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>, under the thin horizontal separator "
"line. The creation and deletion of these bookmark folders is explained "
"below, in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-bookmarks\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Användaren kan lägga till fler ”relativa rötter” som ”bokmärkesmappar”. De "
"ger snabb åtkomst till mappar som används ofta. Bokmärkesmapparna visas i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>, under den tunna vågräta "
"avdelaren. Hur du skapar och tar bort dem beskrivs längre fram i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-save-dialog-bookmarks\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:973
msgid ""
"Changing folders involves selecting a 'relative root' folder, then "
"navigating into the appropriate sub-folder. When the "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> button is pressed, the file will be saved in the"
" folder listed as the right most button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> of <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> which also means that the file will be saved alongside the "
"folders and files listed in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Byt mapp genom att välja en ”relativ rot” och sedan navigera till önskad "
"undermapp. När du klickar på <guibutton>Spara</guibutton> sparas filen i "
"mappen på knappen längst till höger i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/>. Det är också mappen vars innehåll visas i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: procedure/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:986
msgid "The procedure to change the currently selected folder."
msgstr "Så byter du den valda mappen."

#. (itstool) path: procedure/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:990
msgid ""
"To select a new folder, one of the 'relative root' folders which contains "
"the desired folder must first be selected and then the hierarchy must be "
"navigated to find the desired folder. As explained below, a user can move "
"around the hierarchy using as many changes as they need to choose the folder"
" in which to save their <application>Gnumeric</application> file."
msgstr ""
"Börja med att välja en ”relativ rot” som innehåller den önskade mappen. "
"Navigera sedan i hierarkin tills du hittar den. Du kan gå fram och tillbaka "
"så många gånger som behövs för att välja mappen där "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-filen ska sparas."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1000
msgid ""
"Select a 'relative-root' folder in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."
msgstr "Välj en ”relativ rot” i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1004
msgid ""
"The first step in choosing a new folder requires selecting, in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>, a 'relative root' folder which "
"contains the desired folder. The new 'relative root' folder is chosen by "
"placing the mouse pointer over the folder name and double clicking (click "
"twice rapidly without moving the mouse) with the primary mouse button. This "
"will change the leftmost button in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>"
" and change the folders and files listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Börja med att välja den ”relativa rot” som innehåller den önskade mappen i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. Dubbelklicka på mappnamnet med "
"primär musknapp (två snabba klick utan att flytta pekaren). Då ändras "
"knappen längst till vänster i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>, "
"och mapparna och filerna i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> "
"uppdateras."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1019
msgid ""
"Navigate the filesystem to reach the desired folder using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Navigera i filsystemet till önskad mapp med område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1023
msgid ""
"The next step involves descending the folder tree to reach the desired "
"folder. This requires double clicking the sub-folder of the 'relative root' "
"folder which contains the desired folder and continuing through the whole "
"hierarchy until the desired folder is reached. After each double click, the "
"selected folder is added as the right most button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> and the contents of the selected folder are shown"
" in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>. Once the desired folder is "
"reached, it must be opened in the same way, so that its contents are listed "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> and the file can then be saved "
"into this folder by clicking on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Navigera nedåt i mappträdet till önskad mapp. Dubbelklicka på den undermapp "
"till den ”relativa roten” som innehåller mappen du söker och fortsätt sedan "
"genom hierarkin. Efter varje dubbelklick läggs den valda mappen till som "
"knappen längst till höger i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>, och"
" dess innehåll visas i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>. När du "
"har hittat mappen öppnar du den på samma sätt. Då visas innehållet i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, och du kan spara filen där genom att "
"klicka på <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: step/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1042
msgid ""
"Navigating back up the folder tree using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Navigera uppåt i mappträdet med område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1046
msgid ""
"If the sub-folder selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> does"
" not contain the branch of the folder tree leading to the desired folder, "
"the buttons in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> can be used to jump"
" further up the folder tree but only as far as the 'relative root' folder "
"selected in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. Area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> provides a list of buttons with the names of all "
"the folders between the 'relative root' listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and the currently selected folder. By clicking on"
" one of these buttons, that is by placing the mouse pointer over the button "
"and clicking with the primary mouse button, the folder listed on the button "
"will be opened in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> so that the "
"selection process can restart from this branch."
msgstr ""
"Om undermappen som visas i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> inte "
"leder till den önskade mappen kan du använda knapparna i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> för att gå uppåt i trädet, men inte längre än "
"till den ”relativa rot” som valdes i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>. Område <emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> "
"visar knappar med namnen på alla mappar mellan den relativa roten i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> och den valda mappen. Klicka på en "
"knapp med primär musknapp för att öppna mappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>. Därifrån kan du fortsätta välja en annan mapp."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1068
msgid ""
"The process of exploration of the folder tree can continue as long as the "
"user wishes. If the user desires it is also possible to create new folders "
"as is explained next."
msgstr ""
"Du kan fortsätta att utforska mappträdet så länge du vill. Du kan också "
"skapa nya mappar, vilket beskrivs härnäst."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1078
msgid "Adding a folder."
msgstr "Lägga till en mapp."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1082
msgid ""
"Often the user wishes to save the <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"workbook by creating a file in a folder which does not yet exist. A new "
"folder can be added to the folder tree by clicking on the <guibutton>Create "
"Folder</guibutton> button, which is labeled as area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> of <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/>. The button can be clicked by placing the mouse pointer over "
"the button and pressing the primary mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill spara arbetsboken i programmet "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> i en mapp som ännu inte finns kan du "
"skapa den direkt i mappträdet. Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Skapa "
"mapp</guibutton> i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/>. Klicka på knappen "
"med primär musknapp."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1093
msgid ""
"When the <guibutton>Create Folder</guibutton> button is pressed, a folder "
"will be added at the top of the list in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, with its name, <filename>Type name of new "
"folder</filename> already selected so that the user can simply start typing "
"to give the folder a desired name. Once the name has been entered on the "
"keyboard, typing the <keysym>Return</keysym> key (or the "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym> key, depending on the keyboard) will change the "
"folder name and open that folder. Area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> "
"will therefore be empty since the newly created folder has no contents."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på <guibutton>Skapa mapp</guibutton> läggs en mapp till högst"
" upp i listan i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>. Namnet "
"<filename>Type name of new folder</filename> är markerat, så du kan börja "
"skriva det nya namnet direkt. Tryck sedan på <keysym>Retur</keysym> eller "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym>, beroende på tangentbordet, för att byta namn på och "
"öppna mappen. Område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> blir då tomt "
"eftersom den nya mappen inte innehåller några filer."

#. (itstool) path: warning/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1108
msgid ""
"There is no way to delete folders once they have been created, just as there"
" is no way for <application>Gnumeric</application> to delete files it has "
"created. Folders created by mistake must be deleted using a file browser "
"such as <application>Nautilus</application> or using command line programs "
"such as <application>rm</application>."
msgstr ""
"Det går inte att ta bort mappar som har skapats, på samma sätt som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> inte kan ta bort filer som programmet "
"har skapat. Om du har skapat en mapp av misstag måste du ta bort den med en "
"filhanterare, till exempel <application>Nautilus</application>, eller med "
"ett kommandoradsprogram som <application>rm</application>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1127
msgid ""
"The list of 'relative root' folders shown in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> of <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-"
"components\"/> may contain 'relative root' folders selected by the user. "
"These folders are called 'bookmark folders' and are listed in area <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> below a thin horizontal separator line. For "
"example, <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> "
"contains a folder named <filename>currentWork</filename> which is a bookmark"
" folder selected by the user."
msgstr ""
"Listan med ”relativa rötter” i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> i"
" <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> kan innehålla "
"mappar som användaren har valt. De kallas ”bokmärkesmappar” och visas i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>, under en tunn vågrät avdelare. "
"I <xref linkend=\"fig-file-save-dialog-expanded-components\"/> är "
"<filename>currentWork</filename> ett exempel på en bokmärkesmapp som "
"användaren har valt."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1140
msgid ""
"These bookmark folders can be added in two ways. A folder which is selected "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> can be added as a bookmark by "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till bokmärkesmappar på två sätt. Om du vill bokmärka mappen "
"som är vald i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> klickar du på "
"knappen <guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1148
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the folder can be dragged from area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> into area <emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>. "
"The folder can be dragged by placing the mouse pointer over the folder name "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, clicking and holding the "
"primary mouse button, moving the mouse pointer to area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and releasing the mouse button. As the mouse "
"pointer is moved from area <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> to area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>, a small icon of the folder will move "
"with the mouse pointer."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också dra mappen från område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> "
"till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>. Placera pekaren över "
"mappnamnet i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis>, håll ned primär "
"musknapp, dra pekaren till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> och "
"släpp knappen. En liten mappikon följer med pekaren när du drar från område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">I</emphasis> till område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1162
msgid ""
"Any bookmark folder can also be removed from the 'relative root' folders "
"presented in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> (or in the drop down "
"list labeled <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>). A bookmark folder can be"
" removed by clicking on the folder name in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> and then clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även ta bort bokmärkesmappar från listan med ”relativa rötter” i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> (eller från rullgardinslistan i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>). Klicka på mappnamnet i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> och sedan på <guibutton>Ta "
"bort</guibutton> i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">K</emphasis>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1188
msgid "The file formats which Gnumeric can write."
msgstr "Filformat som Gnumeric kan skriva."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1190
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can write files in several formats used "
"by other programs. The details of these formats are provided in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/> and the name of each file type in the table "
"below skips to the appropriate section of <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"formats\"/>. The creation of files which consist of structured text is "
"described in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\"/>. The creation of "
"PostScript and Portable Document Format (PDF) files is done through the "
"printing mechanism and is described in <xref linkend=\"chapter-"
"printing\"/>.<application>Gnumeric</application> can also export text data "
"or HTML and XHTML tables through the clipboard mechanism, as is explained in"
" <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan spara filer i flera format som "
"används av andra program. En beskrivning av formaten finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. Filtyperna i tabellen nedan länkar till "
"motsvarande avsnitt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. I <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textExport\"/> beskrivs hur du skapar strukturerade "
"textfiler. PostScript- och PDF-filer skapas via utskriftsfunktionen, som "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan även exportera textdata och HTML- "
"eller XHTML-tabeller via urklippet, enligt <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-"
"xclipboard\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1208
msgid ""
"Most of these formats are provided by plugins, which are independent, "
"configurable modules. If a format described below does not appear in the "
"<interface>File Save</interface> dialog, this may be because the appropriate"
" plugin has not been configured or started. This can be verified by "
"examining the list of plugins which are currently running in the "
"<interface>Plugin Manager</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"De flesta formaten tillhandahålls av insticksmoduler, som är fristående och "
"konfigurerbara. Om ett format som beskrivs nedan inte visas i dialogrutan "
"<interface>Spara fil</interface> kan det bero på att motsvarande "
"insticksmodul inte har konfigurerats eller startats. Kontrollera detta i "
"dialogrutan <interface>Insticksmodulhanteraren</interface>, där du ser vilka"
" insticksmoduler som körs."

#. (itstool) path: table/title
